  "explanation_short": "This model predicts the performance of a wastewater treatment plant based on various input features. The KNN model achieved the highest R-squared score (0.817) and lowest RMSE (0.113). Key features include VFA, Butyrate, Acetate, and VSS.",
  "explanation_full": "This artifact presents the results of a machine learning experiment focused on predicting wastewater treatment plant performance. The model was trained using various input features such as VFA, Butyrate, Acetate, VSS, Ethanol, COD-O, pH, ORP_Low, and ORP_Mid.  The KNN model demonstrated the best performance with an R-squared score of 0.817 and a RMSE of 0.113. This indicates that the model accurately captures the relationship between input features and plant performance. The feature importance analysis highlights VFA, Butyrate, Acetate, and VSS as the most influential factors in predicting wastewater treatment plant performance.  Further investigation into these features can provide valuable insights for optimizing plant operations and improving efficiency.",
